{
  "version": 3,
  "name": "Drawmer DS201",
  "category": "Dynamics",
  "author": "LiveWDF",
  "description": "One Drawmer DS201 gate lane with the service schematic\u2019s discrete differential JFET gain control, analog key filters, precision rectifier and independent Attack, Hold and Decay networks with diode timing switches. Internal key, Key Listen, Duck, Range and Bypass are available. The external key, linked second channel, LED display and mains supply are excluded.",
